        <problem id="prob-00012">
          <para id="para-00047">7. Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Verify your
            prediction using Desmos tool below.</para>

        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00012">
          <para id="para-00049">Compare your answer: </para>
